Search and recall memories from the memory store. Supports multiple search modes: "hybrid" (semantic + keyword + graph search, requires a query), "recent" (most recent memories by time), "important" (highest importance memories), and "typed" (filter by memory type). Default mode is hybrid. Optional `target_agent_id` lets you search another linked agent's memory store; this requires an active link that permits reads in your direction. If `target_agent_id` points to yourself, the tool falls back to local memory search.
